# This archive is a set of numerical data files, not source code.
# Line-ending conversion would change the bytes of every .data, .lammps and .csv
# file and invalidate the MD5 sums listed in _filelist.tsv and README.md.
# Therefore ALL files are treated as binary: no CRLF<->LF normalisation, no
# end-of-line conversion on checkout, no diff munging.
* -text
